est control\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.50.58-AM-300x158.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.50.58-AM-1024x538.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.50.58-AM-768x403.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.50.58-AM.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/div><\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/why-melbourne-homes-need-professional-termite-pest-control\/\" >\n\t\t\t\tWhy Melbourne Homes Need Professional Termite Pest Control\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>Termites are quiet workers. You will not hear them. You will not see them moving around your home in broad daylight. Yet they can quietly chew through the timber inside your walls, your floors, and even your roof beams for months before you notice anything is wrong. For Melbourne homeowners,<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/why-melbourne-homes-need-professional-termite-pest-control\/\" aria-label=\"Read more about Why Melbourne Homes Need Professional Termite Pest Control\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More \u00bb\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/article>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-10626 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-blog\" role=\"listitem\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__card\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/5-myths-about-wasp-removal-melbourne-you-should-stop-believing\/\" tabindex=\"-1\" ><div class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.52.11-AM-300x158.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-10627\" alt=\"wasp nest melbourne\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.52.11-AM-300x158.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.52.11-AM-1024x538.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.52.11-AM-768x403.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.52.11-AM.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/div><\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/5-myths-about-wasp-removal-melbourne-you-should-stop-believing\/\" >\n\t\t\t\t5 Myths About Wasp Removal Melbourne You Should Stop Believing\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>There is a lot of bad advice out there when it comes to dealing with wasps. People share tips at backyard barbecues, on Facebook groups, and even at the local hardware store. Some of it is harmless. A lot of it can get you stung, badly. If you live in<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/5-myths-about-wasp-removal-melbourne-you-should-stop-believing\/\" aria-label=\"Read more about 5 Myths About Wasp Removal Melbourne You Should Stop Believing\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More \u00bb\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/article>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-10621 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-blog\" role=\"listitem\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__card\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/the-smart-homeowners-guide-to-termite-barrier-protection-in-melbourne\/\" tabindex=\"-1\" ><div class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.53.29-AM-300x158.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-10624\" alt=\"termite barrier\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.53.29-AM-300x158.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.53.29-AM-1024x538.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.53.29-AM-768x403.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.53.29-AM.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/div><\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/the-smart-homeowners-guide-to-termite-barrier-protection-in-melbourne\/\" >\n\t\t\t\tThe Smart Homeowner\u2019s Guide to Termite Barrier Protection in Melbourne\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>If you own a home in Melbourne, you have probably heard about termite damage at least once. Maybe a neighbour found a hollow door frame. Maybe your mate dropped thousands on repairs after a hidden colony was discovered behind the wall. These stories are not rare. They happen every year,<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/the-smart-homeowners-guide-to-termite-barrier-protection-in-melbourne\/\" aria-label=\"Read more about The Smart Homeowner\u2019s Guide to Termite Barrier Protection in Melbourne\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More \u00bb\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/article>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-10614 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-blog\" role=\"listitem\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__card\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/the-dark-secret-above-your-ceiling-why-melbourne-homes-need-a-roof-cavity-check-every-year\/\" tabindex=\"-1\" ><div class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.54-AM-300x158.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-10615\" alt=\"pest control service in melbourne\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.54-AM-300x158.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.54-AM-1024x538.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.54-AM-768x403.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.54-AM.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/div><\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/the-dark-secret-above-your-ceiling-why-melbourne-homes-need-a-roof-cavity-check-every-year\/\" >\n\t\t\t\tThe Dark Secret Above Your Ceiling \u2014 Why Melbourne Homes Need a Roof Cavity Check Every Year\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>Most homeowners in Melbourne spend a lot of time thinking about what is inside their home. Clean floors, tidy kitchens, a well-kept garden. But very few ever stop to think about what might be living just above their ceiling. That space between your roof and your ceiling is called the<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/the-dark-secret-above-your-ceiling-why-melbourne-homes-need-a-roof-cavity-check-every-year\/\" aria-label=\"Read more about The Dark Secret Above Your Ceiling \u2014 Why Melbourne Homes Need a Roof Cavity Check Every Year\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More \u00bb\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/article>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-10612 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-blog\" role=\"listitem\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__card\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/\" tabindex=\"-1\" ><div class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.51-AM-300x158.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-10607\" alt=\"mice pest control melbourne\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.51-AM-300x158.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.51-AM-1024x538.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.51-AM-768x403.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.51-AM.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/div><\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/\" >\n\t\t\t\tPest Control Melbourne Rats: Why Restaurant Kitchens Are the #1 Target for Rodents\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>Let me ask you something. You close your restaurant at night, turn off the lights, lock the door. And then what happens inside your kitchen? Most owners don&#8217;t think about it. But rats and mice? They&#8217;re very much thinking about it. The moment your staff leaves, they come out. They<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/\" aria-label=\"Read more about Pest Control Melbourne Rats: Why Restaurant Kitchens Are the #1 Target for Rodents\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More \u00bb\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/article>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-10595 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-rodent-pest-control\" role=\"listitem\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__card\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/can-one-rat-inside-the-house-become-a-bigger-infestation-heres-the-truth\/\" tabindex=\"-1\" ><div class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/7-states-8-300x158.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-10597\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/7-states-8-300x158.png 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/7-states-8-1024x538.png 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/7-states-8-768x403.png 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/7-states-8.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/div><\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/can-one-rat-inside-the-house-become-a-bigger-infestation-heres-the-truth\/\" >\n\t\t\t\tCan One Rat Inside the House Become a Bigger Infestation? Here\u2019s the Truth\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>Finding a rat in your home is enough to make anyone\u2019s heart skip a beat. You might see a dark shape scurrying across the kitchen floor at night or hear a strange scratching sound in the walls while you\u2019re trying to sleep. Your first thought might be, &#8220;It\u2019s just one.<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/can-one-rat-inside-the-house-become-a-bigger-infestation-heres-the-truth\/\" aria-label=\"Read more about Can One Rat Inside the House Become a Bigger Infestation? Here\u2019s the Truth\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More \u00bb\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/article>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-10594 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-affordable-pest-control-melbourne\" role=\"listitem\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__card\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/office-pest-control-tips-every-melbourne-business-owner-should-follow\/\" tabindex=\"-1\" ><div class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\"